      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "LEV",
          "chapter": 24,
          "verse": 5
        }
      ],
      "en": "“You shall take fine flour, and bake twelve cakes of it: two tenths of an ephah shall be in one cake.",
      "ko": "너는 고운 가루를 취하여 떡 열 둘을 굽되 매 덩이를 에바 십분 이로 하여",
      "source_text_hash": "54c17a071c5c149f2dab551bcf7d0a5e8c7c43da6fe55a3e1429e0c53e4c2387",
      "translation_text_hash": "d61f7ec950ec40b1b83bf66e1be5c8e42434a3cbf336f2aec72868dc13565e13",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "너는 고운 가루를 취하여 떡 열 둘을 굽되 매 덩이를 에바 십분 이로 하여"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "d61f7ec950ec40b1b83bf66e1be5c8e42434a3cbf336f2aec72868dc13565e13"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:LEV:24:6",
      "sequence": 3453,
