      },
      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "LEV",
          "chapter": 24,
          "verse": 12
        }
      ],
      "en": "They put him in custody until the LORD’s will should be declared to them.",
      "ko": "그들이 그를 가두고 여호와의 명령을 기다리더니",
      "source_text_hash": "cbc55adc85e686e1bc822237f2e76325ed20ed4e1995c71bf831b787130521ae",
      "translation_text_hash": "a3324471903027a8ab3f0693eafa09833c18d2b5a19e61e00e736112c8105226",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
